    "description": "The only app a true manga collector needs!\r\nOrganize and manage your collection thanks to a complete and daily updated database.\r\nFollow the profiles of the most loved influencers to find out what their favorite readings are.\r\nThanks to the calendar you will never miss a single issue again and by following the publishers' profiles you will always be able to stay updated on the news!",
